{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127301-dark-eras-2-light-of-the-sun-europe-in-1600s","id":1127301,"title":"[Dark Eras 2] Light of the Sun - Europe in 1600s","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-10T13:46:13-07:00","id":1127301,"title":"[Dark Eras 2] Light of the Sun - Europe in 1600s","content":"Could not found topic about it, so started this one.<br /> <br /> Beyond that (SPANISH!) Inquisition (!!!) trope used for <b>Mage</b> and <b>Deviant</b> games - I just realized that it would be Era about great Seers of Throne reform. First Ministry - Hegemony - was created in year 1600 according to <b>Seers of Throne</b> book. It mentions that Panopticon, Paternoster, Pretorian. ( Weird side note: Rest of Great Ministries are all about letter 'P' - some conspiracy? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> And surely Institution will have Paternostern's funding... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-10-2017, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T14:06:41-07:00","id":1127315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127301-dark-eras-2-light-of-the-sun-europe-in-1600s#post1127301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Panopticon, Paternoster, Pretorian. ( Weird side note: Rest of Great Ministries are all about letter 'P' - some conspiracy? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</div> </div> </div> </div>Consilium, Cabal, Convocation, Column (and you forgot Pylon and Pantechnicon for the Seers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T14:12:49-07:00","id":1127319,"title":"","content":"'C' vs. 'P'... CvP... Or PvC... There need to be something more to it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T14:20:31-07:00","id":1127327,"title":"","content":"Notably, this period includes the later part of Holy Roman Emperor Rudolf II's rule, who was notable for keeping a large number of alchemists and occultists on retainer; he was super interested in astrology, and maintained Europe's greatest cabinet of curiosities. John Dee was a frequent visitor to his court, and Nostradamus did a horoscope for him. I hope Prague features prominently in this Era because of all the fun to be had with him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 08-10-2017, 05:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-10T19:53:18-07:00","id":1127457,"title":"","content":"Now I want too see Uncrowned Kings 2E version that is from before Free Council and is connected to Silver Ladder before! \u263a\ufe0f","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T00:45:12-07:00","id":1127514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127301-dark-eras-2-light-of-the-sun-europe-in-1600s?p=1127327#post1127327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Notably, this period includes the later part of Holy Roman Emperor Rudolf II's rule, who was notable for keeping a large number of alchemists and occultists on retainer; he was super interested in astrology, and maintained Europe's greatest cabinet of curiosities. John Dee was a frequent visitor to his court, and Nostradamus did a horoscope for him. I hope Prague features prominently in this Era because of all the fun to be had with him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kepler (one of the three people mentioned in the outline) was Imperial Mathematician for Rudolf, so perhaps.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T02:23:14-07:00","id":1127527,"title":"","content":"I don't know how far will this era stretch, but in 1629 in the north of Italy, at the time occupied by the Spanish, there was one of the biggest plagues that ever happened in Italy. This may be an obvious retread of the Black Death era, but if you want you can easily add Prometheans and Vampires to it. One of the pillars of Italian literature, The Betrothed by Alessandro Manzoni (it just codified our language, nothing major) is entirely set during these times. Alas, its themes are almost the opposite of those chosen for this era as it's mainly about love and religion in times of strife. It could still help to understand how the common people lived in that particular time and place.<br /> <br /> Of more use, I think, would be the &quot;Storia della colonna infame&quot; (&quot;History of the infamous column&quot;), which detailed the real trial that condamned two innocents men to death because they were tought to be &quot;untori&quot; (aka plague spreaders, who used magic and potions to spread the disease Morbus style). I don't know if it was ever translated in English, as I can't seem to find it. It's usually included in the Italian version of the Bethroted, maybe it's the same in English?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Italian nuisance. English is my second language, so be patient!<br /> <br /> <b>My homebrew:</b><br /> <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/270766-domain-light-from-a-dead-star-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">[VtR 2e] Light From a Dead Star: Rome</span></a></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1117941-hunting-ground-the-past-is-another-country-rome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#8B4513\"><b>[WtF 2e] The Past Is Another Country: Rome</b></span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3765-snesferatu","name":"SNESferatu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3765_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T04:45:48-07:00","id":1128007,"title":"","content":"1600s are also time of creation of Rosicrucian Movement in Europe - here are it's origins from Wikipedia:<br /> <br /> 'Between 1607 and 1616, two anonymous manifestos were published, first in Germany and later throughout Europe. These were the Fama Fraternitatis RC (The Fame of the Brotherhood of RC) and the Confessio Fraternitatis (The Confession of the Brotherhood of RC).<br /> <br /> The Fama Fraternitatis presented the legend of a German doctor and mystic philosopher referred to as &quot;Frater C.R.C.&quot; (later identified in a third manifesto as Christian Rosenkreuz, or &quot;Rose-cross&quot;). The year 1378 is presented as being the birth year of &quot;our Christian Father&quot;, and it is stated that he lived 106 years. After studying in the Middle East under various masters, possibly adhering to Sufism, he was unable to spread the knowledge he had acquired to any prominent European figures. Instead, he gathered a small circle of friends/disciples and founded the Rosicrucian Order (this can be deduced to have occurred around 1407).<br /> <br /> During Rosenkreuz's lifetime, the order was said to consist of no more than eight members, each a doctor and a sworn bachelor. Each member undertook an oath to heal the sick without payment, to maintain a secret fellowship, and to find a replacement for himself before he died. Three such generations had supposedly passed between c. 1500 and c. 1600, a time when scientific, philosophical and religious freedom had grown so that the public might benefit from the Rosicrucians' knowledge, so that they were now seeking good men.'<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1147_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1147\" data-vbnamecard=\"1147\">Baaldam</a> have also interesting points about 'Atlantean writing' of Light of the Sun Era. \u263a\ufe0f","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T10:36:18-07:00","id":1210092,"title":"","content":"Maybe a 100 years before, but this clip perfectly show the take of Catholic Church to the science at that time - example on Nicolaus Copernicus. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vlRHbQEHdRU\" data-code=\"vlRHbQEHdRU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/vlRHbQEHdRU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T18:53:46-07:00","id":1210219,"title":"","content":"Also (since no one has brought it up) remember that Demon also got added to this era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T21:17:46-07:00","id":1210269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127301-dark-eras-2-light-of-the-sun-europe-in-1600s?p=1210219#post1210219\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also (since no one has brought it up) remember that Demon also got added to this era.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are Welcome","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-03T12:30:57-08:00","id":1365083,"title":"","content":"As we finally have this era in <b>Dark Eras</b> 2 then - let's read it...<br /> <br /> I like how Seers are emerging from this times - but it will take them century or two to be real powerful force to push Diamond. My History of Awakened write-up on this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>1517 till 18th century AD:</b> The Seers of the Throne are unifying from various Nameless Orders. Up until the mid-15th century, the Seers of the Throne were not a unified sect, but a tenuous and shifting alliance of small Orders. The early years of the Italian Renaissance and the birth of city-states like Milan and Venice gave rise to the nationalistic Hegemony, who worship the <i>Unity</i>, Iron Seal of Mind and Exarch of control through xenophobia. As the first Ministry, they organized the other proto-Seer cults into similar Ministries, forming a bloc that could more meaningfully oppose the Diamond and enact the Exarchs\u2019 will. This included <i>Paternoster</i> \u2014 cult of the Father, Iron Seal of Prime and Exarch of control through dogma \u2014 though it was a hard sell. Paternoster has been the largest and most cohesive Exarchal Nameless Order since the 13th century and would have stayed independent if the other cults hadn\u2019t fallen in line with Hegemony\u2019s plan. The alliance now is fractious: The Hegemony<br /> supports a Christian Reformation that will fracture Christendom into rival factions, while Paternoster supports the Counter-Reformation to keep papal power consolidated, acutely aware that the Reformation is giving the nobility unprecedented sway over the Church. To the Father\u2019s devout, this assault on their authority is unacceptable. ( <b><i>Light of the Sun</i> \u2013 Dark Eras 2</b>) </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}